---
config:
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
---
graph TD
    subgraph Data_Prep [**Data Preparation**]
        A[Get & Clean Raw Provincial Daily Data] --> B[Aggregate Daily Data to Weekly Scale]
        B --> C[Generate Rescaled Weekly Data from Weekly Data]
    end

    subgraph Modeling [**Forecasting Models**]
        B --> D[Daily and Weekly Model]
        C --> E[Rescaled Weekly Model]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation [**Evaluation**]
        D & E --> F["Forecast Scoring (CRPS)"]
        D & E --> G["Diagnostics (Divergences, ESS tail per second)"]
    end

    subgraph Visualisation [**Visualisation**]
        F --> H["log(Incidence) & log(CRPS)"]
        G --> I["log(Incidence) & log(ESS tail/sec) & ratchets"]
    end
